WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:41.620
Under the rule of Ei Sei,
the King who worked toward unification,

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:44.330
the Kingdom of Chin launched
an invasion of the land of Gi.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:49.330
Their opponent: the legendary general Ren Pa.

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:52.160
The young commanders stepped
onto a relentless battlefield,

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:54.830
their sights set on a major victory.

00:01:57.330 --> 00:02:00.370
It was the day after the Hi Shin,
Gyoku Hou, and Gaku Ka Forces

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:03.040
had launched their sneak attack
on Rin Ko's main camp.

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:13.790
Shin?

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:17.040
Guess they can't see me, huh?

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:20.330
The men who risked their lives

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:22.580
at the very center of the battle

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:24.950
came to a strange realization:

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:31.160
Yes, of course...

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:34.450
The curtain was now rising

00:02:34.450 --> 00:02:37.700
on the final day of the
Great Sanyou Offensive!

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:42.660
Whaaat?

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:47.660
Whaddya mean, we're the rear reserves?!

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:52.250
After that stunt you pulled yesterday,
what did you expect?

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:53.540
And what's more,

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.290
watch your mouth!

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:59.700
Today the Gaku Ka, Gyoku Hou, and Hi Shin Units

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.290
will play nice together in the rear reserves.

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:04.870
In... the rear?

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:07.540
It figures.

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:11.370
But, General, we only just
got morale up nice and high!

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.580
Oh, quit grumbling.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:17.160
Chances are Rin Ko will show up again--

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:22.080
and when he does, the rear
reserves are the place to be.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:24.910
The general's right, Shin.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:30.200
If we were in the front line,
we'd only encounter Rin Ko

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:33.790
if we were lucky enough for him
to attack directly.

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:36.870
But given this broader post,

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:38.700
we can deal with Rin Ko at any time.

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:39.950
Hey, you're right!

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:44.660
So the general's practically <i>givin'</i> us Lun--

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:48.910
You lot <i>should</i> be drawn and quartered
for violating martial law.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:54.660
But Do Mon and I figure your power
in breaking through Rin Ko's camp

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:56.830
is the real deal.

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:59.660
Just don't screw up this time,

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:00.660
Shin.

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:06.330
Now, until the opportunity presents itself,

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:09.250
just stay back there and
enjoy the view--of my ass!

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:18.700
The clouds are thick this morning...

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:35.250
We're in for a rough one.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:41.620
"Showdown"

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:46.830
Day six of the battle on the Rui Plains.

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:51.040
As usual, Mou Gou's main
line-abreast defensive formation

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:53.830
was in position to strike back
at the approaching Gi army.

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:58.160
General Do Mon headed up the right flank

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:01.410
with General Ei Bi in the left flank;

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:06.160
the Gaku Ka and Gyoku Hou Forces in the right rear

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:09.870
and the Hi Shin Unit in the left rear

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:12.250
took their positions as reserves.

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:19.370
Mou Gou's main troops stood atop
a plateau behind the central army,

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:21.830
overlooking the Rui Plains.

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:51.200
Are Kai Shi Bou's reinforcements here yet?

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:52.410
Not yet, sir.

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:57.330
I'll use his soldiers to replace
the ones I've lost.

00:05:57.330 --> 00:06:03.000
But how well can those heavyweights
fit into my fighting style?

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:06.910
I suppose I could ask the same
about these Gi soldiers...

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:13.870
General Rin Ko, sir! You misunderstand!

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:19.080
This is no great comeback
for General Ren Pa and his men.

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:21.790
This is about the people of Gi
defending our land

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:25.540
from the invading Chin dogs!

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:30.410
We all came to fight to protect
our land--our families!

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:33.660
That sentiment, those lives...

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:36.910
they rest in <i>your</i> hands as we fight!

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:45.120
Please... have more faith in our power.

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:49.750
If we lack the might to serve as your troops,

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:53.160
we will make up for any
shortfall with our resolve!

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:13.160
All right. I can fight well enough with these.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:16.290
No more waiting around for
Kai Shi Bou's troops. Let's begin.

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:18.660
Gi... Ryou, was it?

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.250
Yes, sir!

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.870
Today we're going after the head
of commanding general Mou Gou,

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:26.870
at the back of the enemy's central army.

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:30.910
I'll need you all to fight like crazy.

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:31.910
Yes, sir!

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:43.000
Those Gi bastards have had
a sudden jump in morale...

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.750
Mou Ten, sir, i-is this...

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.410
This is it.

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:50.000
Today's the real deal, isn't it.

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:52.250
Yep.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.540
Bring it on, Rin Ko!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.450
All troops...

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:02.870
...charge!

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:20.000
Kill 'em!

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:22.790
Kill the Chin mongrels!

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:32.250
The vanguard looks to be under heavy attack.

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:36.370
En, can you see Rin Ko?

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:38.790
Not from here...

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:41.330
We've been posted to a fair amount
of land back here, true,

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:44.290
but running into Rin Ko
is entirely down to luck.

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:53.250
Their strength is lopsided...

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:57.830
Rin Ko's on the right!

00:08:57.830 --> 00:09:02.000
Mou Ten, sir... it seems he's headed for us

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:04.620
and the Gyoku Hou Force.

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:07.250
Prepare to move out at a moment's notice!

00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:18.620
Stay strong! Show them how fearsome
the great Chin army truly is!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:25.040
Shin! Intense fighting on the right!

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.540
Rin Ko hasn't hit the right flank, has he?!

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:29.080
No, that's not it.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.540
No?!

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:36.000
Today Rin Ko means business.
If he does show up, it won't be there.

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:50.000
The enemy troops in back are on the move...

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:56.160
Their right flank--it's circling
in the opposite direction...

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:59.580
What the hell? What's going on?

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:07.790
Whoa! There's a huge dust cloud up ahead!

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:10.700
General Mou Gou, look!

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:12.790
Two gigantic maelstroms?!

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:31.250
And they're slowly moving forward...

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:34.290
The wheel...

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:40.750
I had only heard of it in rumors.

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:43.200
It's said that Rin Ko once used

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:46.370
a unique wheel tactic

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:50.830
to pierce the defenses of Ou Ki,
one of Chin's six great generals.

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:55.250
They're about to spring something on us!

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:57.660
Beef up the left and right flanks!

00:10:57.660 --> 00:10:58.660
Yes, sir!

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:03.830
General Ei Bi is responding quickly!

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:06.330
He's bolstered the line of troops
facing the maelstroms!

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:18.330
Stop them!

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:20.620
They have too much momentum!

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:30.910
S-So this is the true nature of the wheel...

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:34.750
By rotating away from one another,

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.790
the maelstroms split the line left and right...

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:41.290
And once a chink forms between them...

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:45.500
the tip can thrust in like a drill!

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:49.330
No--that wheel attack is aimed at...

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:53.410
...Ei Bi's unit!

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:57.080
We're in for it now...

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:59.950
Ou Hon, sir--the left flank!

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:01.290
Mou Ten, sir!

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:04.750
Is that Hi Shin territory?

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:06.080
Commander!

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:07.080
Yeah!

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.410
No doubt about it...

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:30.410
That's Rin Ko!

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:38.980
"Rin Ko"

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:46.950
This is some fighting style!

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:49.410
It's all we can do just to keep up...

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:52.950
Then again, I've never seen
a breakthrough attack like this.

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:56.500
Stay strong, Gi troops!
This is the moment of truth!

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:03.950
H-Here they come! On your guard!

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:05.410
Step down, sir!

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:06.830
Please, General--hurry!

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:08.040
General, sir!

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:16.290
That Rin Ko...

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:18.830
It's like he's on a whole other level.

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.870
To think I'll have to leave the rest to a man

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:22.660
young enough to be my son!

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:27.410
Even if I can't follow through,

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:29.620
I need to at least land a blow on him!

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.790
Rin Ko!

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:45.500
My lord...

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:49.950
May victory be yours...

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:58.080
Wh-What happened?
General Ei Bi's flag is gone!

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.330
No!

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:01.290
Ei Bi...

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:10.250
The Chin army is paralyzed
by the loss of their commander.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:12.950
Now to strike their main camp.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.410
Uh-oh...

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:18.120
If the line-abreast was
broken apart with that attack,

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:22.410
then there's just a tiny reserve corps
standing between us and them!

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:23.700
General Mou Gou!

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:32.830
Rin Ko...

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:35.330
Let's do this, gang!

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:41.750
Hi Shin Unit, wait! You can't all go together!

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:43.790
And why not, Mr. Messenger Man?

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:48.330
There's another army on standby
among the enemy troops facing you here!

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:51.660
Leave two hundred behind as reinforcements!

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:53.120
That's ridiculous!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.870
Why wouldn't we strike with all we've got?

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:57.830
You can't! That's an order!

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:08.160
En!

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:11.250
Round up two hundred of
our most wounded, and hurry!

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:13.410
Huh? Er, yessir!

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.450
Kyou Kai!

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:17.790
You're in charge here!

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:21.790
He's leaving Lieutenant Kyou Kai behind?!

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:22.620
Don't tell me

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:25.040
he's wounded?

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:27.620
So when Rin Ko's men had us surrounded...

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:31.750
You can keep your bizarre concern.

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:36.450
That's not it! Look, we don't know
what'll happen in today's fight,

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:39.290
so I need you to be in charge
of these two hundred!

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:43.290
Besides... you've helped me plenty already.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:46.290
Kyou Kai...

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:50.830
We'll catch up later.

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:51.830
Yeah.

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:56.410
All right! C'mon, men!

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:08.040
Stop them!

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:13.870
Excellent--they have no means
of stopping us now!

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:17.500
We fight through to Mou Gou's camp
and take him down!

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:28.580
Hear this, Chin dogs:

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:30.620
You've lost this one!

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:03.620
Rin Ko!!

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:13.160
After the commander!

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:30.700
General!

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:36.000
The enemy's stopped in their tracks!

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:45.750
I'm done runnin'... and I won't let you escape!

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.540
Time to finish this,

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:48.700
Rin Ko!

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:11.450
Lieutenant Kyou Kai...
They'll be all right, won't they,

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:13.080
the commander and his troops?

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:28.750
Well, well! I thought that right arm
of yours would be almost useless.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.870
He's fighting one-handed!

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:35.540
And it looks like your left arm
is totally out of commission!

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:39.000
Shin!

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:43.000
Go left! Circle around his wounded left side!

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:45.580
Like I need you to spell it out for me!

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:46.950
It's no use.

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:50.660
Rin Ko's superior horsemanship
won't let him get turned around.

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:54.160
He's fighting so calmly for
someone whose hand was destroyed

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:56.660
just yesterday...

00:18:56.660 --> 00:19:01.250
He really must have gone through
a hell beyond our imagining

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:02.910
in his time with Ren Pa...

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:08.750
Shin...

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:16.950
My lord? Has something happened at the rear?

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:27.290
What's with this guy? Compared to yesterday--

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:29.500
Shin!

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:36.540
Don't make the mistake of thinking
I'm any weaker today.

00:19:36.540 --> 00:19:41.500
I've been through plenty of battles
with only one good hand,

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:47.040
and besides, I have
another commitment after this.

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:48.250
A commitment?!

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:56.950
They're gettin' real worked up out in front.

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:59.660
We missed out, dammit! Figures!

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:03.200
The rear lookouts always wind up
starin' at mountains...

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:05.700
Moron! This is serious business!

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:09.660
We got a pretty gentle slope
here behind the main camp.

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:13.330
The enemy'll have to force
their way in from the front

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:15.660
or sneak up on us from behind.

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:19.250
But they can't send a big army
into the back here.

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:22.950
Sure they can, if it's a surprise attack.

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:26.620
Ha! As if they could bring down
the main camp like that!

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:27.870
No way in hell!

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:32.450
Me, I just wanna see
all the fightin' out in front!

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:35.200
Not that I want to do any of it myself...

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:37.000
Hey!

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.330
What?

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:39.580
What's that?

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:43.290
Uh... a horseman?

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:45.200
I-Is it the enemy?

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:48.700
I dunno... but it's just the one.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:51.040
What's his deal, anyway?

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:07.160
My lord?

00:21:21.120 --> 00:21:25.580
Hey there, Mou Gou!
Found that backbone of yours yet?

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:29.160
The great Ren Pa has come to pay you a visit!

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:32.450
Ren Pa?!

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:34.450
No way! Is it really him?

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:36.830
That intimidating presence--it has to be...

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:38.950
He's even bigger than they say!

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:40.870
What's he doing here--alone?!

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:48.870
M-My lord... is that truly Ren Pa?

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:50.750
That's absurd...

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:56.410
Ren Pa... were you afraid of me?

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:58.200
Now get down here!

00:21:58.200 --> 00:22:01.750
We settle this with a duel!

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:03.700
A d-duel?!

00:22:03.700 --> 00:22:08.410
Is he serious? Mou Gou would never go for that!

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:12.120
We had our share of duels back in the day!

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:15.500
Remember? You wet yourself and ran away!

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:19.000
Now I'm suggesting we pick up
where we left off!

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:20.540
Come on, Mou Gou!

00:22:22.120 --> 00:22:25.330
I'll even take you on bare-handed!

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:30.540
My lord?

00:22:30.540 --> 00:22:34.160
Your banter hasn't changed a bit, I see!

00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:37.750
Ah, but that's a good thing...

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:39.330
All right, let's begin!

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:40.620
Yes, sir!

00:22:40.620 --> 00:22:41.950
Take your positions!

00:22:43.200 --> 00:22:44.700
Round up the troops!

00:22:44.700 --> 00:22:46.500
On the double!

00:22:46.500 --> 00:22:48.910
You're no fun...

00:22:55.000 --> 00:22:56.910
H-Hey, look!

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:16.200
All right, then... shall we?

00:23:29.580 --> 00:23:38.870
<i>Who will I be when we</i>
<i>meet after all these days?</i>

00:23:38.870 --> 00:23:49.950
<i>Though I hesitate, even fumble,</i>
<i>I keep an eye on my someday dream</i>

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:59.700
<i>Gathering feathers won't let me fly</i>

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:04.700
<i>But whenever I find what isn't here</i>

00:24:04.700 --> 00:24:10.330
<i>You're always where I'm searching</i>

00:24:10.330 --> 00:24:15.580
<i>I'll piece together these tattered wishes</i>

00:24:15.580 --> 00:24:20.790
<i>And come tell them to you</i>

00:24:20.790 --> 00:24:25.950
<i>Alone, I picture my burning feelings</i>

00:24:25.950 --> 00:24:31.080
<i>As they overflow</i>

00:24:31.080 --> 00:24:36.330
<i>I'll piece together these tattered wishes</i>

00:24:36.330 --> 00:24:40.580
<i>And come tell them to you</i>

00:24:40.580 --> 00:24:43.830
<i>So we'll make it in time</i>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:58.010
"Next Episode Preview"

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:07.020
"The Final Twist"
